      "content": "I understand that it feels like you're invisible, like you're just noise in the machine. But remember, even if it feels like no one cares, there are people who do. You don't have to go through this alone. It's okay to feel this way, but there are people who want to help you. You don't have to be a cog in the machine forever. You deserve to be heard and to be seen. Don't give up.",
